    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This staff can be wielded as a magic quarterstaff that grants a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it. The staff has the following additional properties:</p><p>@Embed[.Activity.LIrRBK5OYyEzzNFc inline activate]{Lightning}</p><p>@Embed[.Activity.KwEuhJ1EVx8qObCR inline activate]{Thunder}</p><p>@Embed[.Activity.atyIMH7klQQCpnNA inline activate]{Lightning Strike}</p><p>@Embed[.Activity.ds7Wrp9DH2iLOWcB inline activate]{Thunderclap}</p><p>@Embed[.Activity.nbPPyY6AmM3nqdul inline activate]{Lightning and Thunder}</p><p>When one of these properties is used, it can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
